        "content": [
          "Which voice, when:",
          "",
          "   Street forms: recognise them,",
          "   return them among friends, never",
          "   lead with them to an elder.",
          "",
          "   Standard sanifu — this course —",
          "   is welcome everywhere in East",
          "   Africa: school, office, market,",
          "   radio. It is the safe register",
          "   and the written one.",
          "",
          "   Respect forms cost nothing and",
          "   buy everything.",
          "",
          "Hear it once more:                 Press 1",
